     "type": "objection",
     "object": "obj_mitaltel_male_vereikam",
     "kind": "svara",
     "gloss_en": "והא זמנין דמטלטלי ליה כי מנח ספר תורה עלויה, והוה ליה מיטלטל מלא וריקם! -- it is moved with the scroll on it, so it is a vessel moved full and empty, not one made to rest",
     "against": "p_teiva_kli_lenachat",
     "state": "live"
    },
    {
     "type": "proposition",
     "object": "p_lo_efshar",
     "gloss_en": "if so, it is not possible [to remedy the priests' entry]"
    }
   ]
  },
  "0": {
   "segId": "Megillah.26b.1",
   "sugya": "megillah_26a_mechirat_beit_hakneset",
   "marks": [
    {
     "type": "proposition",
     "object": "p_rava_afilu_shichra",
     "gloss_en": "but if the seven townsmen sold it in the townspeople's presence, even to drink beer with [the money] is fine"
    }
   ]
  },
  "1": {
   "segId": "Megillah.26b.2",
   "sugya": "megillah_26a_mechirat_beit_hakneset",
   "marks": [
    {
     "type": "proposition",
     "object": "p_rav_ashi_tila",
     "gloss_en": "Rav Ashi to Ravina, on sowing a synagogue mound: buy it from the seven townsmen in the townspeople's presence, and sow it"
    }
   ]
  },
  "2": {
   "segId": "Megillah.26b.3",
   "sugya": "megillah_26a_mechirat_beit_hakneset",
   "marks": [
    {
     "type": "proposition",
     "object": "p_rav_chisda_lo_listor",
     "gloss_en": "Rav Chisda: one should not demolish a synagogue until another synagogue is built"
    }
   ]
  },
  "3": {
   "segId": "Megillah.26b.4",
   "sugya": "megillah_26a_mechirat_beit_hakneset",
   "marks": [
    {
     "type": "proposition",
     "object": "p_rava_chalufa_zvina",
     "gloss_en": "Rava: a synagogue -- exchanging it and selling it are permitted"
    }
   ]
  },
  "4": {
   "segId": "Megillah.26b.5",
   "sugya": "megillah_26a_mechirat_beit_hakneset",
   "marks": [
    {
     "type": "proposition",
     "object": "p_livnei_chalufa_zvina",
     "gloss_en": "the bricks too: exchanging and selling them are permitted"
    }
   ]
  },
  "5": {
   "segId": "Megillah.26b.6",
   "sugya": "megillah_26a_mechirat_beit_hakneset",
   "marks": [
    {
     "type": "proposition",
     "object": "p_hazmana_milta",
     "gloss_en": "designation [for a purpose] is significant"
    }
   ]
  },
  "6": {
   "segId": "Megillah.26b.7",
